{"obsah":"<p>We were invited to the expo of BIGMAT, one of the big supporters of the UCI World Cups, which wanted to show its employees and partners a bit of cycling. They chose our team, for which we thank them. The bit of time pressure didn't throw us, we fitted into the space and didn't destroy any of the expensive lasers and LED screens. This time we didn't use our traditional obstacles but stylishly rode on classic pallets, and Vlasta even put on a BigMat T-shirt. He was backed up by Marek Tryner in his first exhibition after his knee injury, Tobík Dolák, who ended up as a volunteer, and Lukáš Valný, who for the first time in his life experienced a technical problem during an exhibition, when his chain snapped after maybe the first 3 jumps on a brand-new bike. Not a great advert for that X9 range.</p>\n\n<p>Thanks for the invitation and the luxurious photos and video.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FDSC02219.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FDSC02219.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-251194\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FDSC02075.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FDSC02075.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-251197\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2026%2F04%2FDSC02082.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://fireba